    <p class="eyebrow">Data science case study · Natpaphon Nukhunthod</p>
    <h1>Cost-aware credit card fraud detection</h1>
    <p class="lede">A model that ranks card transactions by fraud risk, and a step-up threshold chosen to minimise
      expected cost &mdash; with an uncertainty interval on every number.</p>
    <ul class="badges" aria-label="Important caveats">
